{% set local_problem %}
<p>Cullman's tree-lined streets and mature landscaping are part of what makes this community attractive. But all those trees — oaks, pines, maples, and more — produce debris that ends up in your gutters. Pine needles accumulate year-round. Hardwood leaves blanket everything in fall. Seeds, twigs, and pollen add to the mix in spring.</p>

<p>Without protection, Cullman gutters typically need cleaning 2-4 times per year. That's either time you spend on ladders or $150-200+ per professional cleaning. Over years, those costs add up significantly.</p>

<p>More importantly, clogged gutters cause damage. Water overflows against your foundation, soaks into fascia boards, and erodes landscaping. For homeowners who maintain their properties carefully, gutter clogs undermine that effort.</p>

<p>Gutter guards provide the permanent solution — keeping debris out so your gutters function properly year after year with minimal attention.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Gutter guards are covers or screens that fit over or inside your gutters. They allow water to enter while blocking leaves, pine needles, and other debris. The debris either blows away or sits on top where it eventually dries and falls off.</p>

<p>Different guard types work better for different situations. Micro-mesh guards block even fine debris like pine needles and roof grit. Screen guards handle larger leaves effectively. We'll assess your specific debris challenges and recommend the most appropriate solution.</p>

<p>For Cullman's historic homes with half-round gutters, we offer guard options designed specifically for that gutter style — protection without compromising period-appropriate appearance.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've installed gutter guards throughout Cullman County for over 20 years. We know which types work best for the area's mix of pine and hardwood trees, and we take care to recommend solutions that match both your debris challenges and your home's character.</p>

<p>Quality guards, properly installed, provide years of reliable protection. That's what we deliver.</p>
{% endset %}
